msgid "Geometry optimization (OPTG)"
msgstr "几何优化 (OPTG)"

msgid ""
"Automatic geometry optimization is invoked using the ``OPTG`` command. The "
"``OPT`` command available in previous MOLPRO versions is no longer needed "
"and not available any more."
msgstr "使用 ``OPTG`` 命令调用自动几何优化。早期 MOLPRO 版本中可用的 ``OPT`` 命令不再需要且不再可用。"

msgid ""
"The ``OPTG`` command can be used to perform automatic geometry optimizations"
" for all kinds of wavefunctions. For minimum searches, it is usually "
"sufficient to give just the ``OPTG`` command without further options or "
"directives, but many options are available which are described in the "
"following sections."
msgstr ""
"``OPTG`` 命令可用于对各种波函数执行自动几何优化。对于极小值搜索，通常只需给出 ``OPTG`` "
"命令而无需其他选项或指令，但有许多可用选项，将在后续章节中描述。"

msgid ""
"The ``OPTG`` command must be given after the energy calculation to which it "
"refers. If the commands for the energy calculation (e.g. ``HF``, ``KS``, "
"``MP2``, etc.) are in a procedure, the ``OPTG`` must also be in the "
"procedure. Furthermore, no procedures without an energy calculation must "
"directly precede ``OPTG``."
msgstr ""
"``OPTG`` 命令必须放在其引用的能量计算之后。如果能量计算的命令（例如 ``HF``\\ 、\\ ``KS``\\ 、\\ ``MP2`` "
"等）位于过程中，则 ``OPTG`` 也必须位于该过程中。此外，没有能量计算的过程不能直接位于 ``OPTG`` 之前。"

msgid ""
"Various optimization methods can be selected as described in section "
"`selecting the optimization method (METHOD) "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#selecting-the-optimization-method-"
"method>`__. Molpro allows minimization (i.e. search for equilibrium "
"geometries), transition state optimization (i.e. search for saddle points on"
" energy surfaces), and reaction path following. Since Molpro 2023.1 the "
"optimizer developed by J. Baker and P. Pulay (PQSOPT) is available in Molpro"
" and used by default. The method is described in J. Baker et al., J. Chem. "
"Phys. 105, 192 (1996); J. Baker and P. Pulay, J. Chem. Phys. 105, 11100 "
"(1996); J. Baker, J. Comput. Chem. 18, 1079 (1997); J. Baker and P. Pulay, "
"J. Comput. Chem. 21, 69 (2000). It uses delocalized internal coordinates and"
" converges often better than previous optimisers in Molpro. Furthermore, it "
"allows for constraint optimisations. Other available algorithms are based on"
" the *rational function* approach and the *geometry DIIS* approach. Also "
"available is the *quadratic steepest descent following* method of Sun and "
"Ruedenberg (see J. Sun and K. Ruedenberg, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.465994>`__ **99**, 5257 (1993)). This method "
"is often advantageous in Transition State searches. For a detailed "
"discussion of the various older minimization algorithms see F. Eckert, P. "
"Pulay and H.-J. Werner, *J. Comp. Chem* **18**, 1473 (1997). Reaction path "
"following is described in F. Eckert and H.-J. Werner, *Theor. Chem. Acc.* "
"**100**, 21, (1998). Please refer to the references section for citations of"
" the analytic gradient methods."
msgstr ""
"如章节 `选择优化方法 (METHOD) <geometry_optimization_optg.html#selecting-the-"
"optimization-method-method>`__ 所述，可以选择各种优化方法。Molpro "
"允许进行最小化（即搜索平衡几何结构）、过渡态优化（即搜索势能面上的鞍点）以及反应路径跟踪。自 Molpro 2023.1 起，由 J. Baker 和 "
"P. Pulay 开发的优化器 (PQSOPT) 已在 Molpro 中可用并作为默认使用。该方法在 J. Baker 等人，J. Chem. "
"Phys. 105, 192 (1996)；J. Baker 和 P. Pulay，J. Chem. Phys. 105, 11100 "
"(1996)；J. Baker，J. Comput. Chem. 18, 1079 (1997)；J. Baker 和 P. Pulay，J. "
"Comput. Chem. 21, 69 (2000) 中描述。它使用离域内坐标，并且通常比 Molpro "
"中先前的优化器收敛得更好。此外，它允许约束优化。其他可用算法基于\\ *有理函数*\\ 方法和\\ *几何 DIIS*\\ 方法。同样可用的还有 Sun"
" 和 Ruedenberg 的\\ *二次最速下降跟踪*\\ 方法（参见 J. Sun 和 K. Ruedenberg，\\ `J. Chem. "
"Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.465994>`__ **99**, 5257 "
"(1993)）。该方法在过渡态搜索中通常具有优势。关于各种较旧的最小化算法的详细讨论，请参见 F. Eckert、P. Pulay 和 H.-J. "
"Werner，\\ *J. Comp. Chem* **18**, 1473 (1997)。反应路径跟踪在 F. Eckert 和 H.-J. "
"Werner，\\ *Theor. Chem. Acc.* **100**, 21, (1998) 中描述。关于解析梯度方法的引用，请参阅参考文献部分。"

msgid ""
"When analytical gradients are available for the optimized energy these will "
"be used. See section `analytical energy gradients "
"<energy_gradients.html#analytical-energy-gradients>`__ for a list of methods"
" with analytical gradients. Otherwise the gradient will be computed "
"numerically from finite energy differences. Normally, the last computed "
"ground-state energy is used. But the ``VARIABLE`` directive or option can be"
" used to optimize, e.g., Davidson corrected energies, excited states, or "
"counterpoise corrected energies."
msgstr ""
"当优化能量有解析梯度可用时，将使用这些梯度。有关具有解析梯度的方法列表，请参见章节 `解析能量梯度 "
"<energy_gradients.html#analytical-energy-gradients>`__\\ "
"。否则，梯度将通过有限能量差分进行数值计算。通常，使用最后计算的基态能量。但可以使用 ``VARIABLE`` 指令或选项来优化，例如，Davidson"
" 校正能量、激发态或 counterpoise 校正能量。"

msgid ""
"By default the program repeats in each geometry optimization step those "
"commands in the input that are needed to compute the last energy *and* any "
"``variable=value`` assignments in between the last energy calculation and "
"the ``OPTG`` command. For example, for MP2 gradients the commands HF and MP2"
" are needed. The MP2 gradients will then be computed automatically. "
"Variables set by these programs as, e.g., ``ENERGY``, are set as usual in "
"each optimization step. In addition, there is a variable ``OPTSTEP``, which "
"is incremented in each optimization step. Its initial value is zero. To save"
" the results of the initial energy calculation, one can use, e.g.,"
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，程序在每个几何优化步长中重复输入中计算最后一个能量所需的命令\\ *以及*\\ 最后一个能量计算与 ``OPTG`` 命令之间的任何 "
"``variable=value`` 赋值。例如，对于 MP2 梯度，需要 HF 和 MP2 命令。MP2 "
"梯度随后将自动计算。由这些程序设置的变量，例如 ``ENERGY``\\ ，在每个优化步长中照常设置。此外，还有一个变量 ``OPTSTEP``\\ "
"，它在每个优化步长中递增。其初始值为零。要保存初始能量计算的结果，可以使用例如"

msgid ""
"It is also possible to define procedures for the energy calculation, or to "
"specify the first command from which the input should be repeated in each "
"step (see section `options to select the wavefunction and energy to be "
"optimized <geometry_optimization_optg.html#options-to-select-the-"
"wavefunction-and-energy-to-be-optimized>`__). The section of the input which"
" is needed for the geometry optimization must not modify variables that are "
"used in the geometry definition (changes of such variables are ignored, and "
"a warning message is printed)."
msgstr ""
"也可以为能量计算定义过程，或者指定从哪个命令开始，在每一步中应重复输入（参见 `options to select the wavefunction "
"and energy to be optimized <geometry_optimization_optg.html#options-to-"
"select-the-wavefunction-and-energy-to-be-optimized>`__ "
"节）。几何优化所需的输入部分不得修改在几何定义中使用的变量（对此类变量的更改将被忽略，并会打印警告信息）。"

msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

msgid ""
"Most parameters can be given as options on the ``OPTG`` command line, as "
"described in this section. Alternatively, directives can be used, which will"
" be described in section `directives for OPTG "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#directives-for-optg>`__."
msgstr ""
"大多数参数可以作为选项在 ``OPTG`` 命令行中给出，如本节所述。或者，也可以使用指令，这将在 `directives for OPTG "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#directives-for-optg>`__ 节中描述。"

msgid "Options to select the wavefunction and energy to be optimized"
msgstr "用于选择待优化波函数和能量的选项"

msgid ""
"By default, the last computed energy is optimized, and all commands on which"
" the last energy calculation depends are automatically executed. For certain"
" purposes, e.g., optimization of counter-poise corrected energies or "
"Davidson corrected energies, the following options can be used to alter the "
"default behaviour."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，优化的是最后计算的能量，并且自动执行最后一次能量计算所依赖的所有命令。对于某些目的，例如优化反补校正能量或 Davidson "
"校正能量，可以使用以下选项来改变默认行为。"

msgid "Options for optimization methods"
msgstr "优化方法选项"

msgid ""
"``ROTATE`` (logical). If .true., the Cartesian coordinates are transformed "
"to minimize rotations (default=.true.)"
msgstr "``ROTATE``\\ （逻辑值）。若为 .true.，则变换笛卡尔坐标以最小化旋转（默认=.true.）"

msgid "The following options are not available in PQSOPT:"
msgstr "以下选项在 PQSOPT 中不可用："

msgid ""
"Specific options for PQSOPT (for details see `options for the PQS optimizer "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#options-for-the-pqs-optimizer>`__):"
msgstr ""
"PQSOPT 的特定选项（详情见 `PQS 优化器的选项 <geometry_optimization_optg.html#options-for-"
"the-pqs-optimizer>`__\\ ）："

msgid "Options for the PQS optimizer"
msgstr "PQS 优化器的选项"

msgid ""
"Convergence criteria can be specified as for other methods using the "
"``ENERGY``, ``GRADIENT``, and ``STEP`` options (see `options to modify "
"convergence criteria <geometry_optimization_optg.html#options-to-modify-"
"convergence-criteria>`__)."
msgstr ""
"收敛标准可以像其他方法一样使用 ``ENERGY``\\ 、\\ ``GRADIENT`` 和 ``STEP`` 选项来指定（参见 `修改收敛标准的选项"
" <geometry_optimization_optg.html#options-to-modify-convergence-"
"criteria>`__\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"The maximum stepsize can be specified using the ``STEPMAX`` option (see "
"`options for optimization methods <geometry_optimization_optg.html#options-"
"for-optimization-methods>`__)"
msgstr ""
"最大步长可以使用 ``STEPMAX`` 选项指定（参见 `优化方法的选项 "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#options-for-optimization-methods>`__\\ ）"

msgid ""
"Options for numerical gradients and Hessian options work as for other "
"optimization programs (see `options for numerical gradients "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#options-for-numerical-gradients>`__ and "
"`options for computing Hessians <geometry_optimization_optg.html#options-"
"for-computing-hessians>`__)."
msgstr ""
"数值梯度和 Hessian 矩阵选项的工作方式与其他优化程序相同（参见 `数值梯度的选项 "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#options-for-numerical-gradients>`__ 和 `计算 "
"Hessian 矩阵的选项 <geometry_optimization_optg.html#options-for-computing-"
"hessians>`__\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"There are many further options, but only the following may be sometimes "
"relevant:"
msgstr "还有许多其他选项，但只有以下选项有时可能相关："

msgid "``OPTC:``"
msgstr "``OPTC:``"

msgid ""
"``OPTC= 1`` - generate and optimize in internal coordinates; if this fails "
"abort"
msgstr "``OPTC= 1`` - 在内坐标中生成并进行优化；若失败则中止"

msgid ""
"``OPTC=-1`` - generate and optimize in internal coordinates; if this fails "
"switch to Cartesians and continue (default)"
msgstr "``OPTC=-1`` - 在内坐标中生成并进行优化；若失败则切换至笛卡尔坐标并继续（默认）"

msgid ""
"``OPTC= 2``- optimize in Z-Matrix internal coordinates (not supported in "
"Molpro)"
msgstr "``OPTC= 2``- 在 Z-矩阵内坐标中进行优化（Molpro 不支持）"

msgid ""
"``OPTC=-2`` - optimize in Z-Matrix internal coordinates (not supported in "
"Molpro)"
msgstr "``OPTC=-2`` - 在 Z-矩阵内坐标中进行优化（Molpro 不支持）"

msgid ""
"``OPTC= 3`` - large-molecule optimization in Cartesian coordinates (never "
"tested so far)"
msgstr "``OPTC= 3`` - 在笛卡尔坐标中进行大分子优化（迄今从未测试过）"

msgid ""
"``OPTC= 4`` - large-molecule optimization in delocalized internals (never "
"tested so far)"
msgstr "``OPTC= 4`` - 在离域内坐标中进行大分子优化（迄今从未测试过）"

msgid "``IGEN:``"
msgstr "``IGEN:``"

msgid ""
"``IGEN=0`` - generate a set of non-redundant internals and use throughout "
"the optimization"
msgstr "``IGEN=0`` - 生成一组非冗余内坐标并在整个优化过程中使用"

msgid ""
"``IGEN=1``  - generate a new set of non-redundant internals from the same "
"primitive space every cycle (default)"
msgstr "``IGEN=1`` - 每个循环从相同的原始空间生成一组新的非冗余内坐标（默认）"

msgid ""
"``IGEN=2``  - generate a new set of underlying primitives and a new set of "
"non-redundant internals every cycle (not recommended)"
msgstr "``IGEN=2`` - 每个循环生成一组新的底层原始坐标和一组新的非冗余内坐标（不推荐）"

msgid "``ITYPE:``"
msgstr "``ITYPE:``"

msgid "``ITYPE=0`` - standard molecular optimization (default)"
msgstr "``ITYPE=0`` - 标准分子优化（默认）"

msgid ""
"``ITYPE=1`` - optimization of molecule reacting/adsorbed on model surface"
msgstr "``ITYPE=1`` - 在模型表面上反应/吸附的分子的优化"

msgid "``ITYPE=2`` - optimization of molecular clusters (see below)"
msgstr "``ITYPE=2`` - 分子团簇的优化（见下文）"

msgid "``ICONS:``"
msgstr "``ICONS:``"

msgid "``ICONS=0`` - full optimization (no constraints, default)"
msgstr "``ICONS=0`` - 完全优化（无约束，默认值）"

msgid ""
"``ICONS=1`` - constrained optimization using Lagrange multipliers (default "
"if constraints are given see `constraint optimisations using the PQS "
"optimizer <geometry_optimization_optg.html#constraint-optimisations-using-"
"the-pqs-optimizer>`__)"
msgstr ""
"``ICONS=1`` - 使用拉格朗日乘子的约束优化（如果给定了约束，则为默认值，参见 `使用 PQS 优化器的约束优化 "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#constraint-optimisations-using-the-pqs-"
"optimizer>`__\\ ）"

msgid "``ICONS=2`` - constrained optimization using penalty functions"
msgstr "``ICONS=2`` - 使用惩罚函数的约束优化"

msgid "``Cluster optimizations:``"
msgstr "``Cluster optimizations:``"

msgid ""
"Cluster optimizations use inverse distance coordinates for intermolecular "
"degrees of freedom."
msgstr "团簇优化使用逆距离坐标处理分子间自由度。"

msgid ""
"By default, optimizations with z-matrix geometry input are done with the old"
" RF optimizer, and only the active variables in the z-matrix are optimised "
"(cf. `Defining active geometry parameters "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#defining-active-geometry-parameters-"
"active>`__). It is possible, however, to force pqs optimization by giving "
"the optg option ``PQS`` or ``METHOD=PQS``. In this case, all cartesian "
"coordinates will be optimised, and in each iteration the new structure is "
"back-transformed to the z-matrix. If the z-matrix contains constants, these "
"may change and will be overwritten. If the same variable is used in several "
"places of the z-matrix and the corresponding new parameters are not the "
"same, the variable is only kept in the first place, and the further ones are"
" overwritten by the new fixed parameters. The updated z-matrix is printed in"
" the log-file in each iteration."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，使用 Z-矩阵几何输入进行的优化使用旧的 RF 优化器完成，并且仅优化 Z-矩阵中的活动变量（参见 `定义活动几何参数 "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#defining-active-geometry-parameters-"
"active>`__\\ ）。然而，通过给出 optg 选项 ``PQS`` 或 ``METHOD=PQS``\\ ，可以强制进行 pqs "
"优化。在这种情况下，所有笛卡尔坐标都将被优化，并且在每次迭代中，新结构会被反向转换回 Z-矩阵。如果 "
"Z-矩阵包含常量，这些常量可能会改变并被覆盖。如果同一个变量在 "
"Z-矩阵的多个位置使用，并且对应的新参数不相同，则该变量仅保留在第一个位置，后续位置将被新的固定参数覆盖。更新后的 "
"Z-矩阵会在每次迭代中打印在日志文件中。"

msgid "Constraint optimisations using the PQS optimizer"
msgstr "使用 PQS 优化器进行约束优化"

msgid ""
"Constraints can be be defined in an input block (with the OPTG command "
"block) beginning with ``CONSTRAINT`` and ending with ``END``. The possible "
"coordinate types are:"
msgstr "约束可以在以 ``CONSTRAINT`` 开头、以 ``END`` 结尾的输入块（位于 OPTG 命令块内）中定义。可能的坐标类型包括："

msgid ""
"where *I, J, K, L* refer to row numbers in the XYZ input. Alternatively, "
"atom symbols like, e.g. H1, O, H2, can be given, but these must be unique in"
" the input geometry. The coordinate types are:"
msgstr ""
"其中 *I, J, K, L* 指代 XYZ 输入中的行号。或者，也可以给出原子符号，例如 H1, O, "
"H2，但这些符号在输入几何结构中必须是唯一的。坐标类型包括："

msgid ""
"The constraint values have not to be satisfied in the initial geometry. If "
"*value* is not given, the initial value will be kept. The number of "
"constraints is in principle arbitrary, but currently restricted to 20."
msgstr "约束值在初始几何结构中不必满足。如果未指定 *value*\\ ，则将保持初始值。约束数量原则上可以是任意的，但目前限制为 20 个。"

msgid "Example: Keep the distance between atoms 2 and 3 to 1.5 ANG:"
msgstr "示例：将原子 2 和 3 之间的距离保持为 1.5 埃："

msgid ""
"It is possible to define linear combinations of primitive internal "
"coordinates as constraints. These must be defined after the simple "
"constraints (if present). Each composite constraint begins with the keyword "
"``COMPOSITE``. The input of each primitive is as described above, but the "
"``weight`` (the factor in the linear combination) replaces ``value``. The "
"value is given at the end of the first line. Angles in the linear "
"combinations are in radians. The general structure is:"
msgstr ""
"可以定义原始内坐标的线性组合作为约束。这些必须在简单约束（如果存在）之后定义。每个复合约束以关键字 ``COMPOSITE`` "
"开始。每个原始坐标的输入如上所述，但 ``weight``\\ （线性组合中的因子）取代了 ``value``\\ "
"。值在第一行的末尾给出。线性组合中的角度以弧度为单位。一般结构为："

msgid ""
"*value* is the total value of the combined constraint. Note that the weights"
" are normalised. Example:"
msgstr "*值* 是组合约束的总值。请注意权重已归一化。示例："

msgid ""
"will constrain the value of :math:`6^{-1/2}(R_{IJ} - R_{JK} + 2 A_{IJK})` to"
" whatever it is in the starting geometry."
msgstr "将约束 :math:`6^{-1/2}(R_{IJ} - R_{JK} + 2 A_{IJK})` 的值限制为起始几何结构中的值。"

msgid "Options to modify convergence criteria"
msgstr "修改收敛标准的选项"

msgid ""
"The standard Molpro convergency criterion requires the maximum component of "
"the gradient to be less then :math:`3 \\cdot 10^{-4}` [a.u.] and the maximum"
" energy change to be less than :math:`1 \\cdot 10^{-6}` [H] *or* the maximum"
" component of the gradient to be less then :math:`3 \\cdot 10^{-4}` [a.u.] "
"and the maximum component of the step to be less then :math:`3 \\cdot "
"10^{-4}` [a.u.]."
msgstr ""
"标准的 Molpro 收敛标准要求梯度的最大分量小于 :math:`3 \\cdot 10^{-4}` [a.u.] 且能量的最大变化小于 "
":math:`1 \\cdot 10^{-6}` [H] *或者* 梯度的最大分量小于 :math:`3 \\cdot 10^{-4}` [a.u.] "
"且优化步长的最大分量小于 :math:`3 \\cdot 10^{-4}` [a.u.]。"

msgid ""
"It is also possible to use the convergency criterion of the Gaussian program"
" package. It is somewhat weaker than the Molpro criterion and requires the "
"maximum component of the gradient to be less then :math:`4.5 \\cdot 10^{-4}`"
" [a.u.] and the root mean square (RMS) of the gradient to be less then "
":math:`3\\cdot 10^{-4}` [a.u.] as well as the maximum component of the "
"optimization step to be less then :math:`0.0018` [a.u.] and the RMS of the "
"optimization step to be less then :math:`0.0012` [a.u.]."
msgstr ""
"也可以使用 Gaussian 程序包的收敛标准。它比 Molpro 标准稍弱，要求梯度的最大分量小于 :math:`4.5 \\cdot "
"10^{-4}` [a.u.] 且梯度的均方根 (RMS) 小于 :math:`3\\cdot 10^{-4}` "
"[a.u.]，同时优化步长的最大分量小于 :math:`0.0018` [a.u.] 且优化步长的均方根小于 :math:`0.0012` "
"[a.u.]。"

msgid ""
"``BAKER`` (logical). Use Baker’s convergency criteria (see J. Baker, *J. "
"Comp. Chem.* **14**,1085 (1993))."
msgstr ""
"``BAKER`` (逻辑值)。使用 Baker 收敛判据 (参见 J. Baker, *J. Comp. Chem.* **14**,1085 "
"(1993))。"

msgid "``GAUSSIAN`` (logical). Use Gaussian convergency criteria."
msgstr "``GAUSSIAN`` (逻辑值)。使用 Gaussian 收敛判据。"

msgid ""
"Note: The defaults for the convergence parameters can also be changed by "
"using a global ``GTHRESH`` directive, i.e."
msgstr "注意：收敛参数的默认值也可以通过使用全局 ``GTHRESH`` 指令来更改，即"

msgid "Options to specify the optimization space"
msgstr "指定优化空间的选项"

msgid ""
"If the geometry is given as Z-matrix, the default is to optimize the "
"variables on which the Z-matrix depends. In case of ``xyz`` input, always "
"all 3N coordinates are optimized, even if the ``xyz`` input depends on fewer"
" variables. If Cartesian z-matrix input is used, optimization in full space "
"is only enforced if automatic orientation is requested using the ``MASS``, "
"or ``CHARGE`` options on the ``ORIENT`` directive. See *opt_space* in "
"section `optimization coordinates (COORD) "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#optimization-coordinates-coord>`__ for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"如果几何结构以Z-矩阵形式给出，默认优化Z-矩阵所依赖的变量。对于\\ ``xyz``\\ 输入，即使\\ ``xyz``\\ "
"输入依赖于更少的变量，也总是优化所有3N个坐标。如果使用笛卡尔Z-矩阵输入，仅当通过\\ ``ORIENT``\\ 指令上的\\ ``MASS``\\ "
"或\\ ``CHARGE``\\ 选项请求自动定向时，才强制进行全空间优化。详情请参阅\\ `优化坐标 (COORD) "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#optimization-coordinates-coord>`__ 章节中的 "
"*opt_space*\\ 。"

msgid ""
"``SPACE=ZMAT|3N`` Specifies the coordinates to be used in the optimization. "
"Z-matrix optimization is only possible if the geometry is given as Z-matrix."
msgstr "``SPACE=ZMAT|3N`` 指定优化中使用的坐标。仅当几何结构以Z-矩阵形式给定时，才能进行Z-矩阵优化。"

msgid "``OPT3N|3N`` (logical). Same as ``SPACE=3N``"
msgstr "``OPT3N|3N`` (逻辑值)。与 ``SPACE=3N`` 相同"

msgid "``ZMAT`` (logical). Same as ``SPACE=ZMAT``"
msgstr "``ZMAT`` (逻辑值)。与 ``SPACE=ZMAT`` 相同"

msgid "Options to specify the optimization coordinates"
msgstr "指定优化坐标的选项"

msgid ""
"These options specify the coordinates in which the optimization takes place."
" The default is to use local normal coordinates. See *opt_coord* in section "
"`optimization coordinates (COORD) "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#optimization-coordinates-coord>`__ for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"这些选项指定优化所采用的坐标。默认使用局域简正坐标。详情请参阅\\ `优化坐标 (COORD) "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#optimization-coordinates-coord>`__ 章节中的 "
"*opt_coord*\\ 。"

msgid "``COORD=DELO[CALIZED]|NORMAL|NONORMAL|BMAT``"
msgstr "``COORD=DELO[CALIZED]|NORMAL|NONORMAL|BMAT``"

msgid "``NORMAL`` (logical). Same as ``COORD=NORMAL``."
msgstr "``NORMAL`` (逻辑值)。等同于 ``COORD=NORMAL``\\ 。"

msgid "``NONORMAL`` (logical). Same as ``COORD=NONORMAL``."
msgstr "``NONORMAL`` (逻辑值)。等同于 ``COORD=NONORMAL``\\ 。"

msgid "``BMAT`` (logical). Same as ``COORD=BMAT``."
msgstr "``BMAT`` (逻辑值)。等同于 ``COORD=BMAT``\\ 。"

msgid "Options for numerical gradients"
msgstr "数值梯度选项"

msgid ""
"Numerical gradients can be computed with respect to variables on which the "
"Z-matrix depends or with respect to Cartesian coordinates. In the latter "
"case, it is most efficient to use symmetrical displacement coordinates. "
"These do not change the symmetry of the molecule and the number of "
"displacements is minimal. Alternatively (mainly for testing purpose) the "
"gradients can be computed using symmetry unique Cartesian displacements or "
"all 3N Cartesian displacements. In these cases the symmetry of the molecule "
"can be reduced by the displacements and using such displacements is normally"
" not recommended."
msgstr ""
"数值梯度可以相对于 "
"Z-矩阵所依赖的变量或相对于笛卡尔坐标进行计算。在后一种情况下，使用对称位移坐标最为高效。这些坐标不会改变分子的对称性，且位移数量最少。或者（主要用于测试目的），梯度可以使用对称性唯一的笛卡尔位移或所有"
" 3N 个笛卡尔位移来计算。在这些情况下，分子的对称性可能会因位移而降低，通常不建议使用此类位移。"

msgid ""
"``SYMMETRY=AUTO|NOSYM`` Symmetry to be used in wavefunction calculations of "
"numerical gradients. This option is only relevant if "
"``DISPLACE=UNIQUE|CART``. If ``AUTO`` is given, the maximum possible "
"symmetry is used for each displacement. This implies that the energy is "
"independent of the symmetry used. Note that this often not the case in MRCI "
"or CASPT2 calculations. The option can also not be used in local correlation"
" calculations."
msgstr ""
"``SYMMETRY=AUTO|NOSYM`` 在数值梯度的波函数计算中使用的对称性。此选项仅在\\ "
"``DISPLACE=UNIQUE|CART``\\ 时相关。如果指定\\ ``AUTO``\\ "
"，则对每个位移使用最大可能的对称性。这意味着能量与所使用的对称性无关。请注意，在MRCI或CASPT2计算中通常并非如此。此选项也不能用于局域相关计算。"

msgid "``AUTO`` (logical). Same as ``SYMMETRY=AUTO``"
msgstr "``AUTO`` (逻辑值)。等同于\\ ``SYMMETRY=AUTO``"

msgid "``NOSYM`` (logical). Same as ``SYMMETRY=NOSYM``"
msgstr "``NOSYM`` (逻辑值)。等同于\\ ``SYMMETRY=NOSYM``"

msgid ""
"``FOURPOINT`` (logical). Use 4-point formula for accurate numerical "
"gradient."
msgstr "``FOURPOINT`` (逻辑值)。使用四点公式进行精确的数值梯度计算。"

msgid ""
"``NUMERICAL`` (logical). Force the use of numerical gradients, even if "
"gradients are available."
msgstr "``NUMERICAL``\\ （逻辑值）。强制使用数值梯度，即使梯度可用。"

msgid ""
"In special cases the energy calculations may require several steps with "
"different occupations and/or symmetries. In this case the ``FORCEINP`` "
"directive must be given (see section `miscellaneous options: "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#miscellaneous-options>`__)."
msgstr ""
"在特殊情况下，能量计算可能需要多个具有不同占据数和/或对称性的步骤。在这种情况下，必须给出 ``FORCEINP`` 指令（参见 `杂项选项： "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#miscellaneous-options>`__ 一节）。"

msgid "Options for computing Hessians"
msgstr "计算 Hessian 矩阵的选项"

msgid ""
"By default, an approximate Hessian (model Hessian) is used. Optionally, a "
"Hessian can be computed in the optimization or read from a previous Hessian "
"or frequency calculation."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，使用近似 Hessian 矩阵（模型 Hessian 矩阵）。或者，可以在优化过程中计算 Hessian 矩阵，或从先前的 Hessian "
"矩阵或频率计算中读取。"

msgid "``READHESS`` (logical). Same as ``HESSREC=0``."
msgstr "``READHESS``\\ （逻辑值）。与 ``HESSREC=0`` 相同。"

msgid ""
"``HESSCENT`` Use central gradient differences for computing Hessian (only "
"effective if gradients are available)"
msgstr "``HESSCENT`` 使用中心梯度差分计算 Hessian 矩阵（仅在梯度可用时有效）"

msgid ""
"``HESSFORW`` Use forward gradient differences for computing Hessian (only "
"effective if gradients are available). This effectively computes the Hessian"
" at a slightly displaced geometry, but needs only half the number of "
"displacements. This is the default."
msgstr ""
"``HESSFORW`` 使用前向梯度差分计算 Hessian 矩阵（仅在梯度可用时有效）。这实际上是在一个略微位移的几何结构上计算 Hessian "
"矩阵，但只需要一半的位移次数。这是默认设置。"

msgid ""
"``NUMDIAG`` If true, replace diagonal elements of model hessian by diagonal "
"numerical hessian (if available). This sometimes improves convergence, but "
"since it may lead to symmetry breaking it is no the default."
msgstr ""
"``NUMDIAG`` 如果为真，则用对角数值 Hessian 矩阵（如果可用）替换模型 Hessian "
"矩阵的对角元。这有时可以改善收敛性，但由于可能导致对称性破缺，因此不是默认设置。"

msgid ""
"Note that there are restrictions for computing Hessians for multireference "
"methods (MCSCF, MRCI, ACPF,AQCC,RS2). For these methods the symmetry must "
"not change by any displacements, since this could change the occupations and"
" states and may lead to non-contiguous potential energy surfaces. One of the"
" following three options can be used in these cases:"
msgstr ""
"请注意，对于多参考方法（MCSCF、MRCI、ACPF、AQCC、RS2）计算 Hessian "
"矩阵存在限制。对于这些方法，任何位移都不得改变对称性，因为这可能会改变占据数和状态，并可能导致不连续的势能面。在这些情况下，可以使用以下三种选项之一："

msgid "Use no symmetry from the beginning (``NOSYM``)."
msgstr "从一开始就不使用对称性（\\ ``NOSYM``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"Use symmetric displacement coordinates. This is the default if the "
"optimization is done in 3N cartesian coordinates. One can use "
"``OPTG,DISPLACE=SYMM`` to force the use of symmetrical displacements (this "
"creates 3N cartesian coordinates if a Z-matrix is used in the geometry "
"input)."
msgstr ""
"使用对称位移坐标。如果在 3N 笛卡尔坐标中进行优化，这是默认设置。可以使用 ``OPTG,DISPLACE=SYMM`` "
"来强制使用对称位移（如果在几何输入中使用 Z-矩阵，这将创建 3N 笛卡尔坐标）。"

msgid ""
"Use a Z-matrix with the restriction that no variable in the Z-matrix may "
"change the symmetry. For example, ``geometry={O;H1,O,r;H2,O,r,H1,theta}`` "
"would work, but ``geometry={O;H1,O,r1;H2,O,r2,H1,thetai}`` would not work. "
"In this case the program prints a warning message. If an incorrect Z-matrix "
"is used and the symmetry changes, the program will crash."
msgstr ""
"使用 Z-矩阵，但限制条件是 Z-矩阵中的任何变量都不得改变对称性。例如，\\ "
"``geometry={O;H1,O,r;H2,O,r,H1,theta}`` 可以工作，但 "
"``geometry={O;H1,O,r1;H2,O,r2,H1,thetai}`` 则不行。在这种情况下，程序会打印一条警告信息。如果使用了错误的 "
"Z-矩阵且对称性发生改变，程序将崩溃。"

msgid "Miscellaneous options:"
msgstr "杂项选项："

msgid ""
"``VARSAVE`` Save Cartesian gradients in variables ``GRADX, GRADY, GRADZ``."
msgstr "``VARSAVE`` 将笛卡尔梯度保存到变量 ``GRADX, GRADY, GRADZ`` 中。"

msgid "``NONUC`` Do not compute gradients at lattice points."
msgstr "``NONUC`` 不在晶格点计算梯度。"

msgid "``DEBUG`` Set debug print options."
msgstr "``DEBUG`` 设置调试打印选项。"

msgid ""
"``APPEND`` (logical). If given, existing ``SAVEACT`` and/or ``SAVEGRD`` "
"files are appended."
msgstr "``APPEND`` (逻辑值)。若指定，则追加到现有的 ``SAVEACT`` 和/或 ``SAVEGRD`` 文件。"

msgid ""
"``REWIND`` (logical). If given, the ``SAVEACT`` and/or ``SAVEGRD`` files are"
" rewound at each step, i.e. only the last geometry or gradient is saved, "
"previous values are overwritten."
msgstr ""
"``REWIND`` (逻辑值)。若指定，则在每一步重绕 ``SAVEACT`` 和/或 ``SAVEGRD`` "
"文件，即仅保存最后的几何结构或梯度，先前值将被覆盖。"

msgid ""
"``FORCEINP`` (logical) Disables the mechanism that freezes the occupations "
"during geometry optimizations. If this option is given, the occupations and "
"wave function definitions given in the input for the energy calculations are"
" strictly obeyed."
msgstr ""
"``FORCEINP`` (逻辑值) 禁用几何优化过程中冻结占据数的机制。如果给出此选项，则严格遵循能量计算输入中给出的占据数和波函数定义。"

msgid "Directives for OPTG"
msgstr "OPTG 的指令"

msgid ""
"An alternative way to specify options is to use directives, as described in "
"this section. In some cases this allows more detailed specifications than "
"with the options on the ``OPTG`` command. In particular, directives "
"``ACTIVE`` or ``INACTICE`` can be used to define the optimization space in "
"more detail."
msgstr ""
"指定选项的另一种方法是使用指令，如本节所述。在某些情况下，这允许比 ``OPTG`` 命令上的选项更详细的规范。特别是，指令 ``ACTIVE`` 或 "
"``INACTICE`` 可用于更详细地定义优化空间。"

msgid "Selecting the optimization method (METHOD)"
msgstr "选择优化方法 (METHOD)"

msgid "*key* defines the optimization method."
msgstr "*key* 定义了优化方法。"

msgid "For *minimization* the following options are valid for *key*:"
msgstr "对于\\ *极小化*\\ ，以下选项对 *key* 有效："

msgid "``PQS`` PQS optimizer (default for full (3N) optimisations)."
msgstr "``PQS`` PQS 优化器（全 (3N) 优化的默认设置）。"

msgid "``RF`` Rational Function method (default for Z-matrix optimisations)."
msgstr "``RF`` 有理函数法（Z-矩阵优化的默认设置）。"

msgid ""
"``AH`` Augmented Hessian method. This is similar to ``RF`` algorithm but "
"uses a more sophisticated step restriction algorithm."
msgstr "``AH`` 增广 Hessian 方法。此方法与 ``RF`` 算法类似，但使用了更复杂的步长限制算法。"

msgid "``QSD`` Quadratic steepest descent method of Sun and Ruedenberg."
msgstr "``QSD`` Sun 和 Ruedenberg 的二次最速下降法。"

msgid "``SRMIN`` Old version of ``QSD``."
msgstr "``SRMIN`` ``QSD`` 的旧版本。"

msgid ""
"For *transition state* searches (invoked with the ``ROOT`` option, see "
"section `transition state (saddle point) optimization (ROOT) "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#transition-state-saddle-point-optimization-"
"root>`__) *key* can be"
msgstr ""
"对于\\ *过渡态*\\ 搜索（通过 ``ROOT`` 选项调用，参见章节 `transition state (saddle point) "
"optimization (ROOT) <geometry_optimization_optg.html#transition-state-"
"saddle-point-optimization-root>`__\\ ），\\ *key* 可以是"

msgid ""
"``PQS`` PQS optimizer using internal coordinates (default for full (3N "
"optimisations)."
msgstr "``PQS`` 使用内坐标的 PQS 优化器（默认为完整 (3N) 优化）。"

msgid "``DIIS`` Pulay’s Geometry DIIS method (see above)."
msgstr "``DIIS`` Pulay 的几何 DIIS 方法（见上文）。"

msgid ""
"``QSD`` Quadratic Steepest Descent Transition State search using the image "
"Hessian method (see J. Sun and K. Ruedenberg, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.467721>`__ **101**, 2157 (1994)) The use of "
"this option is recommended for transition state searches – especially in "
"complicated cases. The optimization step is checked and the Hessian is "
"recalculated when approaching a troublesome region of the PES. Thus **this "
"method is somewhat safer (and often faster) in reaching convergence than the"
" RF or DIIS method**. The Hessian recalculation safeguard may be turned off "
"using the ``METHOD,QSD,NOHESS`` input card."
msgstr ""
"``QSD`` 使用镜像 Hessian 矩阵方法的二次最速下降过渡态搜索（参见 J. Sun 和 K. Ruedenberg, `J. Chem. "
"Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.467721>`__ **101**, 2157 "
"(1994)）。推荐在过渡态搜索中使用此选项——尤其是在复杂情况下。优化步长会被检查，并且在接近势能面的困难区域时会重新计算 Hessian "
"矩阵。因此，\\ **此方法在达到收敛方面比 RF 或 DIIS 方法更安全（且通常更快）**\\ 。可以使用 "
"``METHOD,QSD,NOHESS`` 输入卡关闭 Hessian 重新计算保护机制。"

msgid "``SRTRANS`` Old version of ``QSD``."
msgstr "``SRTRANS`` ``QSD`` 的旧版本。"

msgid "For *reaction path following* the input *key* is"
msgstr "对于\\ *反应路径跟踪*\\ ，输入 *key* 是"

msgid ""
"``QSDPATH`` Quadratic Steepest Descent reaction path following. This methods"
" determines reaction paths (intrinsic reaction coordinates, IRCs) by "
"following the exact steepest descent lines of subsequent quadratic "
"approximations to the potential energy surface. The Hessian matrix is "
"calculated numerically at the first optimization step and subsequently "
"updated by Powell or BFGS update. If a given arc length of the steepest "
"descent lines is exceeded, the Hessian is recalculated numerically (see "
"``OPTION`` section `reaction path following options (OPTION) "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#reaction-path-following-options-"
"option>`__). For details see J. Sun and K. Ruedenberg, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.465995>`__ **99**, 5269 (1993) It is also "
"possible to recalculate the Hessian after each *m* steps using the "
"``NUMHES``,\\ *m* command (see section `numerical Hessian (NUMHESS) "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#numerical-hessian-numhess>`__). If the "
"Hessian matrix is recalculated in every optimization step (``NUMHES``,\\ "
":math:`1`) a algorithm different to the one with updated Hessians is used, "
"which is very accurate. Using the ``PRINT,OPT`` card, this algorithm prints "
"in every optimization step a *reaction path point r* which is different from"
" the point where the energy and the gradient is calculated but closer to the"
" real reaction path (for further details of the algorithm see J. Sun and K. "
"Ruedenberg, `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.465994>`__ **99**,"
" 5257 (1993)). For further input options of the QSD reaction path following "
"see ``OPTION`` section `reaction path following options (OPTION) "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#reaction-path-following-options-option>`__."
msgstr ""
"``QSDPATH`` "
"二次最速下降反应路径跟踪。此方法通过跟踪后续对势能面的二次近似的最速下降线来确定反应路径（内禀反应坐标，IRCs）。Hessian "
"矩阵在第一个优化步长进行数值计算，随后通过 Powell 或 BFGS 更新进行更新。如果超过给定最速下降线的弧长，则重新数值计算 Hessian "
"矩阵（参见 ``OPTION`` 章节 `reaction path following options (OPTION) "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#reaction-path-following-options-"
"option>`__\\ ）。详情参见 J. Sun 和 K. Ruedenberg, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.465995>`__ **99**, 5269 (1993)。也可以使用 "
"``NUMHES``,\\ *m* 命令在每个 *m* 步后重新计算 Hessian 矩阵（参见章节 `numerical Hessian "
"(NUMHESS) <geometry_optimization_optg.html#numerical-hessian-numhess>`__\\ "
"）。如果在每个优化步长都重新计算 Hessian 矩阵（\\ ``NUMHES``,\\ :math:`1`\\ ），则使用与更新 Hessian "
"矩阵不同的算法，该算法非常精确。使用 ``PRINT,OPT`` 卡时，此算法在每个优化步长打印一个\\ *反应路径点 r*\\ "
"，该点与计算能量和梯度的点不同，但更接近真实的反应路径（有关算法的更多细节，请参见 J. Sun 和 K. Ruedenberg, `J. Chem. "
"Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.465994>`__ **99**, 5257 (1993)）。有关 QSD "
"反应路径跟踪的更多输入选项，请参见 ``OPTION`` 章节 `reaction path following options (OPTION) "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#reaction-path-following-options-"
"option>`__\\ 。"

msgid "``SRSTEEP`` Old Version of ``QSDPATH``."
msgstr "``SRSTEEP`` ``QSDPATH`` 的旧版本。"

msgid "Optimization coordinates (COORD)"
msgstr "优化坐标 (COORD)"

msgid ""
"It is possible to use various coordinate types and algorithms for the "
"optimization. This can be controlled by additional subcommands as described "
"in this and the following subsections."
msgstr "可以使用多种坐标类型和算法进行优化。这可以通过本节及后续小节中描述的子命令来控制。"

msgid ""
"These options choose the optimization space and the coordinate system in "
"which the optimization takes place."
msgstr "这些选项选择优化发生的优化空间和坐标系。"

msgid ""
"*opt_space* defines the parameters to be optimized. By default, if the "
"geometry input is given in Z-matrix format, all variables on which the "
"Z-matrix depends are optimized. Subsets of the variables on which the "
"Z-matrix depends can be chosen using the ``ACTIVE`` or ``INACTIVE`` "
"subdirectives. If the Z-matrix depends on no variables or ``xyz`` input is "
"used, all :math:`3N` cartesian coordinates are optimized."
msgstr ""
"*opt_space* 定义要优化的参数。默认情况下，如果几何输入以 Z-矩阵格式给出，则优化 Z-矩阵所依赖的所有变量。可以使用 ``ACTIVE``"
" 或 ``INACTIVE`` 子指令选择 Z-矩阵所依赖变量的子集。如果 Z-矩阵不依赖任何变量或使用了 ``xyz`` 输入，则优化所有 "
":math:`3N` 个笛卡尔坐标。"

msgid "*opt_space* can be one of the following:"
msgstr "*opt_space* 可以是以下之一："

msgid ""
"``ZMAT`` Optimize all variables on which the Z-matrix depends (default if "
"the geometry is given as Z-matrix)."
msgstr "``ZMAT`` 优化 Z-矩阵所依赖的所有变量（如果几何结构以 Z-矩阵形式给出，则为默认值）。"

msgid ""
"*opt_coord* determines the coordinates in which the optimization takes "
"place. Optionally, delocalized internal coordinates, local normal "
"coordinates, cartesian coordinates, or natural internal coordinates can also"
" be used."
msgstr "*opt_coord* 决定优化在哪种坐标中进行。可选地，也可以使用离域内坐标、局域简正坐标、笛卡尔坐标或自然内坐标。"

msgid "*opt_coord* can be one of the following:"
msgstr "*opt_coord* 可以是以下之一："

msgid ""
"``DELO[CALIZED]`` Optimization in delocalized internal coordinates using "
"PQSOPT (available in Molpro 2023.1 or later). This is the default for full "
"space (3N) optimisations. If the option is given, 3N optimization is "
"enforced (but constraints can be defined)."
msgstr ""
"``DELO[CALIZED]`` 使用 PQSOPT 在离域内坐标中进行优化（适用于 Molpro 2023.1 或更高版本）。这是全空间 (3N) "
"优化的默认设置。如果给出此选项，则强制执行 3N 优化（但可以定义约束）。"

msgid "``NORMAL`` Optimization in local normal coordinates."
msgstr "``NORMAL`` 在局域简正坐标中进行优化。"

msgid "``NONORM`` Don’t use local normal coordinates."
msgstr "``NONORM`` 不使用局域简正坐标。"

msgid ""
"If the option [``NOROT``] is given, the cartesian coordinates are not "
"transformed to minimize rotations."
msgstr "如果给出选项 [``NOROT``]，则笛卡尔坐标不会被变换以最小化旋转。"

msgid "Displacement coordinates (DISPLACE)"
msgstr "位移坐标 (DISPLACE)"

msgid ""
"see section `choice of coordinates (COORD) <energy_gradients.html#choice-of-"
"coordinates-coord>`__ for details."
msgstr ""
"详见 `坐标选择 (COORD) <energy_gradients.html#choice-of-coordinates-coord>`__ 章节。"

msgid "Defining active geometry parameters (ACTIVE)"
msgstr "定义活性几何参数 (ACTIVE)"

msgid ""
"Declares variable name *param* to be active in the optimization. By default,"
" initially all variables on which the geometry depends are active; inclusion"
" of an ``ACTIVE`` card makes all parameters inactive unless explicitly "
"declared active (see also ``INACTIVE``)."
msgstr ""
"声明变量名 *param* 在优化中为活性。默认情况下，初始时所有几何结构依赖的变量都是活性的；包含 ``ACTIVE`` "
"卡片会使所有参数变为非活性，除非被显式声明为活性（另见 ``INACTIVE``\\ ）。"

msgid "Defining inactive geometry parameters (INACTIVE)"
msgstr "定义非活性几何参数 (INACTIVE)"

msgid ""
"Declares variable name *param* to be inactive in the optimization. If any "
"``ACTIVE`` card appears in the input, this card is ignored! (see also "
"``ACTIVE``)"
msgstr ""
"声明变量名 *param* 在优化中为非活动状态。如果输入中出现任何 ``ACTIVE`` 卡片，则忽略此卡片！（另见 ``ACTIVE``\\ ）"

msgid "Hessian approximations (HESSIAN)"
msgstr "Hessian 矩阵近似（HESSIAN）"

msgid ""
"By default, the Molpro geometry optimization utilizes a force field "
"approximation to the hessian (“Model Hessian”, see R. Lindh, A. "
"Bernhardsson, G. Karlström and P. Malmqvist `Chem. Phys. Lett. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0009-2614(95)00646-L>`__ **241**, 423 (1995)), "
"which speeds up convergence significantly. The Model Hessian is "
"parameterized for the elements up to the third row. Alternatively, the model"
" Hessian of Schlegel can be used, or the Hessian can be computed numerically"
" (see also section `numerical Hessian (NUMHESS) "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#numerical-hessian-numhess>`__)."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，Molpro 几何优化使用力场近似来估算 Hessian 矩阵（“模型 Hessian 矩阵”，参见 R. Lindh, A. "
"Bernhardsson, G. Karlström 和 P. Malmqvist 的 `Chem. Phys. Lett. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0009-2614(95)00646-L>`__ **241**, 423 "
"(1995)），这显著加快了收敛速度。该模型 Hessian 矩阵的参数化适用于第三周期及之前的元素。或者，可以使用 Schlegel 的模型 "
"Hessian 矩阵，也可以数值计算 Hessian 矩阵（另见章节 `数值 Hessian 矩阵 (NUMHESS) "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#numerical-hessian-numhess>`__\\ ）。"

msgid "where *options* can be"
msgstr "其中 *options* 可以是"

msgid "``MODEL`` Use Lindh’s Model Hessian in optimization (default)."
msgstr "``MODEL`` 在优化中使用 Lindh 的模型 Hessian 矩阵（默认）。"

msgid "``MODEL=SCHLEGEL`` Use Schlegel’s Model Hessian."
msgstr "``MODEL=SCHLEGEL`` 使用 Schlegel 的模型 Hessian 矩阵。"

msgid "``MODEL=VDW`` Add vdW terms to Lindh’s Model Hessian."
msgstr "``MODEL=VDW`` 向 Lindh 的模型 Hessian 矩阵添加范德华项。"

msgid "``SCHLEGEL`` same as ``MODEL=SCHLEGEL``."
msgstr "``SCHLEGEL`` 与 ``MODEL=SCHLEGEL`` 相同。"

msgid "``VDW`` same as ``MODEL=VDW``."
msgstr "``VDW`` 与 ``MODEL=VDW`` 相同。"

msgid "``NOMODEL`` Don’t use Model Hessian approximation to the hessian."
msgstr "``NOMODEL`` 不使用模型 Hessian 矩阵近似。"

msgid ""
"In transition state searches the Hessian is evaluated numerically in the "
"first iteration by default. Alternatively, if ``READ`` is specified, a "
"previously computed hessian is used."
msgstr ""
"在过渡态搜索中，默认情况下，Hessian 矩阵会在第一次迭代中进行数值计算。或者，如果指定了 ``READ``\\ ，则使用先前计算的 Hessian"
" 矩阵。"

msgid "Numerical Hessian (NUMHESS)"
msgstr "数值 Hessian 矩阵 (NUMHESS)"

msgid "or"
msgstr "或"

msgid "The following options can be given:"
msgstr "可以给出以下选项："

msgid ""
"``SYMM`` Use symmetric displacement coordinates (default). This is the only "
"recommended option. ``CART`` Use :math:`3N` cartesian displacements (not "
"recommended). This requires many more energy calculations than necessary and"
" does not preserve the molecular symmetry. ``UNIQUE`` Use symmetry-unique "
"cartesian displacements (not recommended)"
msgstr ""
"``SYMM`` 使用对称位移坐标（默认）。这是唯一推荐的选项。\\ ``CART`` 使用 :math:`3N` "
"笛卡尔位移（不推荐）。这需要比必要多得多的能量计算，并且不保留分子对称性。\\ ``UNIQUE`` 使用对称性唯一的笛卡尔位移（不推荐）"

msgid "Hessian elements (HESSELEM)"
msgstr "Hessian 矩阵元 (HESSELEM)"

msgid "[optgeo:hesselem]"
msgstr "[optgeo:hesselem]"

msgid ""
"sets the starting value for hessian matrix element between active variables "
"*active1*, *active2* to *value*. If *active2* is omitted it defaults to "
"*active1* (diagonal element). As many ``HESSELEM`` directives as needed may "
"be given."
msgstr ""
"将活动变量 *active1* 和 *active2* 之间的 Hessian 矩阵元的初始值设置为 *value*\\ 。如果省略 "
"*active2*\\ ，则默认为 *active1*\\ （对角元）。可以根据需要给出任意多个 ``HESSELEM`` 指令。"

msgid "Hessian update (UPDATE)"
msgstr "Hessian 更新 (UPDATE)"

msgid ""
"This directive chooses the update type and limits the number of points used "
"for the hessian update to *maxupd*. The default number of steps used in "
"hessian update procedures is 5. If there are symmetry constraint in the "
"coordinates of the optimization, the default number may be lower than five."
msgstr ""
"此指令选择更新类型，并将用于 Hessian 更新的点数限制为 *maxupd*\\ 。Hessian 更新过程中使用的默认步数为 "
"5。如果优化的坐标中存在对称性约束，默认步数可能少于五步。"

msgid "In minimizations *type* may be"
msgstr "在最小化过程中，\\ *type* 可以是"

msgid "``BFGS`` Use BFGS update of hessian (default)."
msgstr "``BFGS`` 使用 Hessian 的 BFGS 更新（默认）。"

msgid "``IBFGS`` Use BFGS update of the inverse hessian."
msgstr "``IBFGS`` 使用逆 Hessian 的 BFGS 更新。"

msgid "``CGRD`` Use Conjugate Gradient update (see also ``CUT``,\\ ``TRUST``)."
msgstr "``CGRD`` 使用共轭梯度更新（另见 ``CUT``,\\ ``TRUST``\\ ）。"

msgid "``NONE`` Don’t do any update."
msgstr "``NONE`` 不进行任何更新。"

msgid "In transition state optimizations *type* may be"
msgstr "在过渡态优化中，\\ *type* 可以是"

msgid "``PMS`` Combined Powell/Murtagh-Sargent update of hessian (default)."
msgstr "``PMS`` 组合 Powell/Murtagh-Sargent 的 Hessian 矩阵更新方法（默认）。"

msgid "``POWELL`` Use Powell’s update of the hessian."
msgstr "``POWELL`` 使用 Powell 的 Hessian 矩阵更新方法。"

msgid "``MS`` Use update procedure of Murtagh and Sargent."
msgstr "``MS`` 使用 Murtagh 和 Sargent 的更新过程。"

msgid "Numerical gradients (NUMERICAL)"
msgstr "数值梯度 (NUMERICAL)"

msgid ""
"For each active variable, two energy calculations are necessary in each "
"geometry optimization step – so numerical optimizations may be expensive! In"
" optimizations of 3N coordinates symmetrical displacement coordinates are "
"normally used to minimize the number of energy calculations. (see section "
"`choice of coordinates (COORD) <energy_gradients.html#choice-of-coordinates-"
"coord>`__)."
msgstr ""
"对于每个活动变量，在每次几何优化步长中都需要进行两次能量计算——因此数值优化可能非常耗时！在3N坐标优化中，通常使用对称位移坐标来最小化能量计算的次数。（参见章节"
" `choice of coordinates (COORD) <energy_gradients.html#choice-of-"
"coordinates-coord>`__\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"For optimization of special energies see ``VARIABLE`` section `optimizing "
"energy variables (VARIABLE) <geometry_optimization_optg.html#optimizing-"
"energy-variables-variable>`__."
msgstr ""
"关于特殊能量的优化，请参见 ``VARIABLE`` 章节 `optimizing energy variables (VARIABLE) "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#optimizing-energy-variables-variable>`__\\ "
"。"

msgid "``CENTRAL`` Use central differences for gradient (default)"
msgstr "``CENTRAL`` 对梯度使用中心差分（默认）"

msgid "``FORWARD`` Use forward differences (not recommended for gradient)."
msgstr "``FORWARD`` 使用前向差分（不推荐用于梯度）。"

msgid ""
"``FOURPOINT`` Use four-point formula for very accurate numerical gradients."
msgstr "``FOURPOINT`` 使用四点公式以获得非常精确的数值梯度。"

msgid ""
"``SYMM`` Use symmetric displacement coordinates (default). This is the only "
"recommended option."
msgstr "``SYMM`` 使用对称位移坐标（默认）。这是唯一推荐选项。"

msgid ""
"``CART`` Use :math:`3N` cartesian displacements (not recommended). This "
"requires many more energy calculations than necessary and does not preserve "
"the molecular symmetry."
msgstr "``CART`` 使用 :math:`3N` 笛卡尔位移（不推荐）。这需要比必要多得多的能量计算，并且不保持分子对称性。"

msgid ""
"``UNIQUE`` Use symmetry-unique cartesian displacements (not recommended)"
msgstr "``UNIQUE`` 使用对称性唯一的笛卡尔位移（不推荐）"

msgid "Transition state (saddle point) optimization (ROOT)"
msgstr "过渡态（鞍点）优化 (ROOT)"

msgid "Specifies the eigenvector of the hessian to be followed."
msgstr "指定要跟随的 Hessian 矩阵的特征向量。"

msgid ""
"In the present implementation a saddle point search is possible with the "
"rational function method (``METHOD,RF``), the geometry DIIS method "
"(``METHOD,DIIS``) and the quadratic steepest descent method of Sun and "
"Ruedenberg (``METHOD,SRTRANS``)."
msgstr ""
"在当前实现中，鞍点搜索可通过有理函数法（\\ ``METHOD,RF``\\ ）、几何 DIIS 法（\\ ``METHOD,DIIS``\\ ）以及 "
"Sun 和 Ruedenberg 的二次最速下降法（\\ ``METHOD,SRTRANS``\\ ）进行。"

msgid ""
"Note that convergence is usually much more difficult to achieve than for "
"minimizations. In particular, a good starting geometry and a good "
"approximation to the hessian is needed. The latter is achieved by evaluating"
" the hessian numerically (see section `numerical Hessian (NUMHESS) "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#numerical-hessian-numhess>`__) or using a "
"precomputed hessian (see section `hessian approximations (HESSIAN) "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#hessian-approximations-hessian>`__)."
msgstr ""
"请注意，收敛通常比最小化要困难得多。特别是，需要一个良好的起始几何结构和 Hessian 矩阵的良好近似。后者可通过数值计算 Hessian "
"矩阵（参见章节 `数值 Hessian 矩阵 (NUMHESS) <geometry_optimization_optg.html#numerical-"
"hessian-numhess>`__\\ ）或使用预先计算的 Hessian 矩阵（参见章节 `Hessian 矩阵近似 (HESSIAN) "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#hessian-approximations-hessian>`__\\ ）来实现。"

msgid "Example:"
msgstr "示例："

msgid "Setting a maximum step size (STEP)"
msgstr "设置最大步长 (STEP)"

msgid ""
"*steplength* is the initial step length in the scaled parameter space "
"(default 0.3). In the AH-method this is dynamically adjusted, and can have a"
" maximum value *ahmax* (see ``TRUST``)."
msgstr ""
"*steplength* 是缩放参数空间中的初始步长（默认 0.3）。在 AH 方法中，此值会动态调整，并可以有一个最大值 *ahmax*\\ （参见 "
"``TRUST``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"*drmax* is the initial max change of distances (in bohr, default 0.3). In "
"the AH-method this is dynamically adjusted up to a maximum value of *drmax1*"
" (default 0.5 bohr)."
msgstr ""
"*drmax* 是距离的初始最大变化量（以玻尔为单位，默认值 0.3）。在 AH 方法中，此值会动态调整，最大可达 *drmax1*\\ （默认值 "
"0.5 玻尔）。"

msgid ""
"*damax* is the initial max change of angles (in degree, default 2). In the "
"AH-method this is dynamically adjusted up to a maximum value of *damax1* "
"(default 10 degrees)."
msgstr ""
"*damax* 是角度的初始最大变化量（以度为单位，默认值 2）。在 AH 方法中，此值会动态调整，最大可达 *damax1*\\ （默认值 10 "
"度）。"

msgid "Redefining the trust ratio (TRUST)"
msgstr "重新定义信任比 (TRUST)"

msgid ""
"*ratio* determines the radius around the current minimum in which points are"
" used to update the Hessian with the conjugate gradient method (default 0.5;"
" see also ``UPDATE``)."
msgstr ""
"*ratio* 决定了在当前极小点周围用于通过共轭梯度法更新 Hessian 矩阵的点的半径（默认值 0.5；另见 ``UPDATE``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"*ahmax* is the maximum step size allowed in the Augmented Hessian procedure."
" This refers to the scaled parameter space (default 0.5). The initial step "
"size is *stepmx* (see ``STEP`` card)."
msgstr ""
"*ahmax* 是增广 Hessian 过程中允许的最大步长。这指的是缩放参数空间（默认值 0.5）。初始步长为 *stepmx*\\ （见 "
"``STEP`` 卡片）。"

msgid "Setting a cut parameter (CUT)"
msgstr "设置截断参数 (CUT)"

msgid ""
"Specifies a threshold for ortho-normalization used in conjugate gradient "
"update of hessian (default 1.d-3; see also ``UPDATE``)."
msgstr "指定用于 Hessian 矩阵共轭梯度更新中正交归一化的阈值（默认值为 1.d-3；另见 ``UPDATE``\\ ）。"

msgid "Line searching (LINESEARCH)"
msgstr "线搜索 (LINESEARCH)"

msgid ""
"Interpolate the geometry of the stationary point (minimum or saddle point) "
"by a quartic polynomial between the current and the previous geometry. If "
"*iflag*\\ =0 or no *iflag* is set, the next optimization step will be taken "
"from the interpolated geometry using the interpolated energy and gradient. "
"If *iflag*\\ =1 the energy and gradient will be recalculated at the "
"interpolated geometry before taking the new optimization step. Note though, "
"that the additional effort of recalculating the energy and gradient is "
"usually not met by the increase of the convergence rate of the optimization."
" *thrlmin* and *thrlmax* are min and max thresholds for the recalculation of"
" the energy and the gradient in case *iflag*\\ =1. I.e. the recalculation "
"just takes place if the interpolated geometry isn’t too close to the actual "
"geometry *thrlmin* and isn’t too remote from the actual geometry *thrlmax*. "
"Default values are *thrlmin*\\ =0.001 and *thrlmax*\\ =0.05 in the scaled "
"parameter space of the optimization."
msgstr ""
"在当前几何结构与前一几何结构之间，使用四次多项式对稳定点（极小值点或鞍点）的几何结构进行插值。如果 *iflag*\\ =0 或未设置 "
"*iflag*\\ ，则下一个优化步长将使用插值得到的能量和梯度从插值几何结构处开始。如果 *iflag*\\ "
"=1，则在采取新的优化步长之前，将在插值几何结构处重新计算能量和梯度。但请注意，重新计算能量和梯度的额外开销通常无法通过优化收敛速率的提升来弥补。\\ "
"*thrlmin* 和 *thrlmax* 是在 *iflag*\\ =1 "
"情况下重新计算能量和梯度的最小和最大阈值。也就是说，仅当插值几何结构距离实际几何结构不太近（\\ *thrlmin*\\ ）且不太远（\\ "
"*thrlmax*\\ ）时，才会进行重新计算。在优化的缩放参数空间中，默认值为 *thrlmin*\\ =0.001 和 *thrlmax*\\ "
"=0.05。"

msgid "Reaction path following options (OPTION)"
msgstr "反应路径跟踪选项 (OPTION)"

msgid ""
"``IDIR`` If starting at a transition state (or near a transition state) "
"determine where to take the first step. If ``IDIR=0`` is chosen, the first "
"step will be towards the transition state. This is the default. If "
"``IDIR=1`` is given in the input the first optimization step will be along "
"the ”transition vector” i.e. the hessian eigenvector to the smallest "
"eigenvalue which points down towards the minimum. If using a larger ``IDIR``"
" parameter, the first step will be larger; if using a negative value, the "
"first step will be in the opposite direction."
msgstr ""
"``IDIR`` 如果从过渡态（或接近过渡态）开始，确定第一步的方向。如果选择 ``IDIR=0``\\ "
"，第一步将朝向过渡态。这是默认设置。如果在输入中给出 ``IDIR=1``\\ ，第一个优化步长将沿着“过渡向量”进行，即指向最小值的、对应最小特征值的"
" Hessian 矩阵特征向量。如果使用更大的 ``IDIR`` 参数，第一步将更大；如果使用负值，第一步将沿相反方向。"

msgid ""
"``STPTOL`` If using an updated hessian matrix, this parameter determines "
"what update to take. If the step size between two subsequent points on which"
" the steepest decent lines are puzzled together is smaller than *stptol* "
"(i.e. if we are close to a minimum) the BFGS update is used, otherwise it is"
" Powell update. The default value of *stptol* is :math:`1.d-6`. Note that "
"the stepsize is also affected by the ``STEPMAX`` option."
msgstr ""
"``STPTOL`` 如果使用更新的 Hessian 矩阵，此参数决定采用何种更新方式。如果连接最速下降线的两个连续点之间的步长小于 "
"*stptol*\\ （即，如果我们接近一个极小值），则使用 BFGS 更新，否则使用 Powell 更新。\\ *stptol* 的默认值为 "
":math:`1.d-6`\\ 。请注意，步长也受 ``STEPMAX`` 选项的影响。"

msgid ""
"``SLMAX`` This option is only valid with the old version of the reaction "
"path following algorithm (i.e. ``METHOD,SRSTEEP``). In this algorithm "
"``slmax`` determines the frequency of the recalculation of the numerical "
"hessian. If the total step size of the last steps exceeds *slmax* the "
"hessian will be recalculated, otherwise it will be updated. By default "
"*slmax* is two times the maximum step size of the optimization step "
"*steplength* (see ``STEP`` section `setting a maximum step size (STEP) "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#setting-a-maximum-step-size-step>`__). If "
"you are using ``METHOD,QSD``, the ``SLMAX`` option is obsolete and the "
"``NUMHES`` command (see above) should be used instead."
msgstr ""
"``SLMAX`` 此选项仅对旧版本的 反应路径跟踪 算法有效（即 ``METHOD,SRSTEEP``\\ ）。在此算法中，\\ ``slmax`` "
"决定了重新计算 数值 Hessian 矩阵 的频率。如果最后几步的总步长超过 *slmax*\\ ，则将重新计算 Hessian "
"矩阵，否则将对其进行更新。默认情况下，\\ *slmax* 是 优化步长 *steplength* 的 最大步长 的两倍（请参阅 ``STEP`` 章节"
" `setting a maximum step size (STEP) "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#setting-a-maximum-step-size-step>`__\\ "
"）。如果您使用 ``METHOD,QSD``\\ ，则 ``SLMAX`` 选项已过时，应改用 ``NUMHES`` 命令（见上文）。"

msgid "These options can also be given on the ``OPTG`` command line."
msgstr "这些选项也可以在 ``OPTG`` 命令行上给出。"

msgid "Optimizing energy variables (VARIABLE)"
msgstr "优化能量变量 (VARIABLE)"

msgid ""
"Defines a variable *name* which holds the energy value to be optimized in "
"using finite differences. By default, this is ``ENERGY(1)`` as set by the "
"most recent program. Other variables which can be used are"
msgstr ""
"定义一个变量 *name*\\ ，该变量保存要使用 有限差分 进行优化的能量值。默认情况下，这是由最近程序设置的 ``ENERGY(1)``\\ "
"。可以使用的其他变量有"

msgid ""
"These variables are set automatically by the CI and/or CCSD programs. It is "
"the user’s responsibility to use the correct variable name; an error exit "
"occurs if the specified variable has not been defined by the last program or"
" the user."
msgstr "这些变量由 CI 和/或 CCSD 程序自动设置。用户有责任使用正确的变量名；如果指定的变量未被上一个程序或用户定义，将发生错误退出。"

msgid ""
"Note: The use of the ``VARIABLE`` option triggers ``NUMERICAL``, so "
"optimization can be very inefficient!"
msgstr "注意：使用 ``VARIABLE`` 选项会触发 ``NUMERICAL``\\ ，因此优化可能非常低效！"

msgid "Printing options (PRINT)"
msgstr "打印选项 (PRINT)"

msgid ""
"Enables printing options. Usually level should be omitted or 0; values of "
":math:`level>0` produce output useful only for debugging. *code* can be"
msgstr "启用打印选项。通常 level 应省略或设为 0；\\ :math:`level>0` 的值产生的输出仅对调试有用。\\ *code* 可以是"

msgid ""
"``HESSIAN`` prints the updated hessian matrix. Note that its diagonal "
"elements are printed anyway."
msgstr "``HESSIAN`` 打印更新后的 Hessian 矩阵。请注意，其对角元无论如何都会被打印。"

msgid ""
"``HISTORY`` prints the complete set of previous geometries, gradients and "
"energies."
msgstr "``HISTORY`` 打印先前所有几何结构、梯度和能量的完整集合。"

msgid "``GRADIENT`` prints extended gradient information"
msgstr "``GRADIENT`` 打印扩展的梯度信息"

msgid ""
"``OPT`` prints detailed information about the optimization process (mainly "
"for debugging)."
msgstr "``OPT`` 打印优化过程的详细信息（主要用于调试）。"

msgid "Several print options can be specified with one ``PRINT`` command."
msgstr "多个打印选项可以通过一个 ``PRINT`` 命令指定。"

msgid "Conical Intersection optimization (CONICAL)"
msgstr "锥形交叉优化 (CONICAL)"

msgid "[conical]"
msgstr "[conical]"

msgid ""
"To optimize a conical intersection between two electronic states having the "
"same spin, three vectors must be evaluated at SA-CPMCSCF level:"
msgstr "为了优化具有相同自旋的两个电子态之间的锥形交叉，必须在SA-CPMCSCF级别评估三个向量："

msgid "Non-Adiabatic Derivative Coupling (DC)."
msgstr "非绝热导数耦合 (DC)。"

msgid "Gradient of the lower state (LSG)."
msgstr "较低电子态的梯度 (LSG)。"

msgid "Gradient of the upper state (USG)."
msgstr "较高电子态的梯度 (USG)。"

msgid ""
"This requires three different ``CPMCSCF`` directives in the MULTI input:"
msgstr "这需要在MULTI输入中使用三个不同的 ``CPMCSCF`` 指令："

msgid ""
"where :math:`S_i`,\\ :math:`S_j` are the electronic states in the usual "
"format *istate.istsym*, and *record[n].file* specifies the name and the file"
" number where CPMCSCF solutions should be stored. Parameter ``SPIN`` is half"
" of the value in the ``WF`` card used to define the electronic state."
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`S_i`,\\ :math:`S_j` 是以常规格式 *istate.istsym* 表示的电子态，而 "
"*record[n].file* 指定了存储 CPMCSCF 解的文件名和文件编号。参数 ``SPIN`` 是用于定义电子态的 ``WF`` "
"卡片中数值的一半。"

msgid "Things to remember:"
msgstr "注意事项："

msgid ""
"Specify always three different *record.file* on the ``CPMCSCF`` directives."
msgstr "在 ``CPMCSCF`` 指令中始终指定三个不同的 *record.file*\\ 。"

msgid "Evaluate the CPMCSCF for USG always last."
msgstr "始终最后计算 USG 的 CPMCSCF。"

msgid ""
"Skip the DC evaluation if the conical intersection involves states with "
"different spin (e.g., a Singlet/Triplet crossing) because the coupling is "
"then zero."
msgstr "如果锥形交叉涉及自旋不同的态（例如，单重态/三重态交叉），则跳过 DC 计算，因为此时耦合为零。"

msgid ""
"Three sets of ``FORCE`` commands (only two for Singlet/Triplet intersection)"
" follow the ``MULTI`` input. They will be like:"
msgstr "三组 ``FORCE`` 命令（对于单重态/三重态交叉只需两组）跟在 ``MULTI`` 输入之后。它们将类似于："

msgid ""
"where *record.file* is one of the records containing CPMCSCF info and "
"*record4.file* points to a free record used for internal storage by the "
"CONICAL code. *record4.file* must be the same on all the ``CONICAL`` "
"directives. Furthermore, the present implementation works properly only if "
"*file=1* on the ``CONICAL`` directive. The optional keyword ``NODC`` must be"
" used in case of different spins (e.g., S/T crossing) when DC is not needed."
msgstr ""
"其中 *record.file* 是包含 CPMCSCF 信息的记录之一，而 *record4.file* 指向 CONICAL "
"代码用于内部存储的自由记录。所有 ``CONICAL`` 指令中的 *record4.file* 必须相同。此外，当前实现仅在 ``CONICAL`` "
"指令上 *file=1* 时才能正常工作。可选关键字 ``NODC`` 必须在不同自旋（例如，S/T 交叉）且不需要 DC 的情况下使用。"

msgid ""
"The actual optimization is performed using ``OPTG,STARTCMD=MULTI`` The "
"example below optimizes the conical intersection in :math:`LiH_2` (ground "
"and excited states are both doublets)."
msgstr ""
"实际优化使用 ``OPTG,STARTCMD=MULTI`` 执行。以下示例优化了 :math:`LiH_2` 中的锥形交叉（基态和激发态均为双重态）。"

msgid ""
"This second example optimizes the singlet-triplet intersection in "
":math:`LiH_2(+)` (ground state is Singlet, excited state is Triplet). Though"
" the optimization works for this example, one has to be careful, as the "
"intersection between states of different symmetry or spin when spin-orbit "
"coupling is not included leads to an energy difference whose first "
"derivative does not vanish at degeneracy. Most geometry optimisation "
"algorithms assume the opposite."
msgstr ""
"第二个示例优化了 :math:`LiH_2(+)` 中的单重态-"
"三重态交叉（基态为单重态，激发态为三重态）。尽管优化对此示例有效，但必须小心，因为当不包含自旋-"
"轨道耦合时，不同对称性或自旋的状态之间的交叉会导致能量差的一阶导数在简并点不为零。大多数几何优化算法假设相反的情况。"

msgid "Using the SLAPAF program for geometry optimization"
msgstr "使用 SLAPAF 程序进行几何优化"

msgid ""
"It is optionally possible to use the ``SLAPAF`` program written by Roland "
"Lindh for geometry optimizations. This is done by prepending the "
"optimization method with ’SL’. The following methods are supported:"
msgstr ""
"可以选择使用 Roland Lindh 编写的 ``SLAPAF`` 程序进行几何优化。这是通过在优化方法前加上 'SL' 来完成的。支持以下方法："

msgid "``SLRF`` Use the rational function approximation;"
msgstr "``SLRF`` 使用有理函数近似；"

msgid "``SLNR`` Use the Newton-Raphson method;"
msgstr "``SLNR`` 使用牛顿-拉夫森方法；"

msgid "``SLC1`` Use the C1-DIIS method;"
msgstr "``SLC1`` 使用 C1-DIIS 方法；"

msgid "``SLC2`` Use the C2-DIIS method."
msgstr "``SLC2`` 使用 C2-DIIS 方法。"

msgid ""
"When using DIIS methods (``SLC1`` or ``SLC2``), the DIIS parameters are "
"specified in the same way as in standard molpro optimizer."
msgstr "当使用 DIIS 方法（\\ ``SLC1`` 或 ``SLC2``\\ ）时，DIIS 参数的指定方式与标准 Molpro 优化器中的相同。"

msgid "There are some differences when using the ``SLAPAF`` program:"
msgstr "使用 ``SLAPAF`` 程序时存在一些差异："

msgid "It is not possible to use Z-matrix coordinates in the optimization."
msgstr "在优化中无法使用 Z-矩阵坐标。"

msgid ""
"Instead, one can explicitly define internal coordinates to be varied or "
"fixed."
msgstr "相反，可以显式定义要变化或固定的内坐标。"

msgid ""
"Additional constraints can be imposed on the converged geometry in a "
"flexible way."
msgstr "可以灵活地对收敛后的几何结构施加额外的约束。"

msgid "Defining constraints"
msgstr "定义约束"

msgid ""
"Constraints and internal coordinates (see below) can be linear combinations "
"of bonds, angles etc. The latter, called here primitive internal "
"coordinates, can be specified before the constraints definition, or directly"
" inside. The general definition of a primitive coordinate is:"
msgstr ""
"约束和内坐标（见下文）可以是键长、键角等的线性组合。后者，在此称为原始内坐标，可以在约束定义之前指定，或直接在内部指定。原始坐标的一般定义是："

msgid ""
"Here *symbolic name* is the name given to the primitive coordinate (if "
"omitted, it will be generated automatically). This name is needed for "
"further reference of this primitive coordinate."
msgstr "这里 *符号名称* 是赋予原始坐标的名称（如果省略，将自动生成）。此名称用于后续引用此原始坐标。"

msgid "*explicit definition* has the form:"
msgstr "*显式定义* 的形式为："

msgid "*type,atoms*"
msgstr "*类型,原子*"

msgid "*type* can be one of the following:"
msgstr "*type* 可以是以下之一："

msgid "``BOND`` Bond length, defined by 2 atoms."
msgstr "``BOND`` 键长，由 2 个原子定义。"

msgid "``ANGLE`` Bond angle, defined by 3 atoms (angle 1–2–3)."
msgstr "``ANGLE`` 键角，由 3 个原子定义（角 1–2–3）。"

msgid ""
"``DIHEDRAL`` Dihedral angle, defined by 4 atoms (angle between the planes "
"formed by atoms 1,2,3 and 2,3,4, respectively)."
msgstr "``DIHEDRAL`` 二面角，由 4 个原子定义（分别由原子 1,2,3 和 2,3,4 形成的平面之间的夹角）。"

msgid ""
"``OUTOFPLANE`` Out-of-plane angle, defined by 4 atoms (angle between the "
"plane formed by atoms 2,3,4 and the bond 1–4)."
msgstr "``OUTOFPLANE`` 面外角，由 4 个原子定义（由原子 2,3,4 形成的平面与键 1–4 之间的夹角）。"

msgid ""
"``DISSOC`` A dissociation coordinate, defined by two groups of atoms (Not "
"permitted with constraints)."
msgstr "``DISSOC`` 解离坐标，由两组原子定义（不允许与约束一起使用）。"

msgid "``CARTESIAN`` Cartesian coordinates of an atom."
msgstr "``CARTESIAN`` 一个原子的笛卡尔坐标。"

msgid "For all types except ``DISSOC`` and ``CARTESIAN``, atoms are given as:"
msgstr "对于除 ``DISSOC`` 和 ``CARTESIAN`` 之外的所有类型，原子按以下方式给出："

msgid ""
"where the number of atoms required varies with *type* as specified above, "
"and the atomic names *a1,a2,a3,...* can be either atomic tag names from the "
"Z-matrix input, or integers corresponding to Z-matrix rows. Note that the "
"square brackets are required here and do not indicate optional input."
msgstr ""
"其中所需的原子数量随上述指定的 *type* 而变化，原子名称 *a1,a2,a3,…* 可以是来自 Z-矩阵输入的原子标签名称，也可以是对应于 "
"Z-矩阵行的整数。请注意，此处的方括号是必需的，并不表示可选输入。"

msgid "For ``DISSOC`` the specification is as follows:"
msgstr "对于 ``DISSOC``\\ ，其规范如下："

msgid ""
"The corresponding internal coordinate is the distance between the centres of"
" mass of the two groups."
msgstr "相应的内坐标是两个基团质心之间的距离。"

msgid "For ``CARTESIAN`` the definition is"
msgstr "对于 ``CARTESIAN``\\ ，其定义为"

msgid ""
"where *I* can be one of ``X,Y,Z`` or 1,2,3 and *atom* can be a z-matrix atom"
" name or an integer referring to the z-matrix row."
msgstr "其中 *I* 可以是 ``X,Y,Z`` 或 1,2,3 之一，而 *atom* 可以是 Z-矩阵原子名称或指代 Z-矩阵行的整数。"

msgid "With this definition, the constraints are defined as"
msgstr "通过此定义，约束条件定义为"

msgid ""
"``CONSTRAINT``,[``VALUE=``]\\ *value*,[*unit*],[[``FACTOR=``]\\ *fac*,\\ "
"*prim*,[[``FACTOR=``]\\ *fac*],\\ *prim,...;*"
msgstr ""
"``CONSTRAINT``,[``VALUE=``]\\ *value*,[*unit*],[[``FACTOR=``]\\ *fac*,\\ "
"*prim*,[[``FACTOR=``]\\ *fac*],\\ *prim,…;*"

msgid ""
"where *value* is the value imposed to the constraint, and *prim* is either "
"the name of the primitive defined before this constraint, or an explicit "
"definition; and *fac* is a factor of the corresponding primitive in the "
"constraint. If *fac* is omitted it is taken to be 1."
msgstr ""
"其中 *value* 是施加给约束的值，\\ *prim* 可以是此约束之前定义的基本量的名称，或显式定义；\\ *fac* "
"是约束中对应基本量的因子。如果省略 *fac*\\ ，则取为 1。"

msgid ""
"If *value* is specified in ``Angstrom`` or ``Radian``, *unit* must be given."
msgstr "如果 *value* 以 ``Angstrom`` 或 ``Radian`` 指定，则必须给出 *unit*\\ 。"

msgid "Examples for H\\ :math:`_2`\\ O in :math:`C_s` symmetry:"
msgstr "以 :math:`C_s` 对称性下的 H\\ :math:`_2`\\ O 为例："

msgid "Constraining the bond angle to 100 degrees:"
msgstr "将键角约束为 100 度："

msgid "``constraint,100,deg,angle,atoms=[h1,o,h2];``"
msgstr "``constraint,100,deg,angle,atoms=[h1,o,h2];``"

msgid "which is equivalent to"
msgstr "这等价于"

msgid "``primitive,a1,angle,atoms=[h1,o,h2];``"
msgstr "``primitive,a1,angle,atoms=[h1,o,h2];``"

msgid "``constraint,100,a1;``"
msgstr "``constraint,100,a1;``"

msgid "Keeping the two OH distances equal:"
msgstr "保持两个 OH 键距相等："

msgid "``constraint,0,bond,atoms=[h1,o],-1.,bond,atoms=[h2,o];``"
msgstr "``constraint,0,bond,atoms=[h1,o],-1.,bond,atoms=[h2,o];``"

msgid "``primitive,b1,bond,atoms=[h1,o];``"
msgstr "``primitive,b1,bond,atoms=[h1,o];``"

msgid "``primitive,b2,bond,atoms=[h2,o];``"
msgstr "``primitive,b2,bond,atoms=[h2,o];``"

msgid "``constraint,0,b1,-1.,b2;``"
msgstr "``constraint,0,b1,-1.,b2;``"

msgid "Defining internal coordinates"
msgstr "定义内坐标"

msgid ""
"By default ``SLAPAF`` optimizes in force-constant weighted normal "
"coordinates that are determined automatically. However, the user can define "
"his own coordinates. The definition of internal coordinates, similar to "
"constraints, is based on primitive coordinates. The input is:"
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，\\ ``SLAPAF`` "
"在自动确定的力常数加权简正坐标中进行优化。然而，用户可以定义自己的坐标。内坐标的定义，类似于约束，是基于原始坐标的。输入格式为："

msgid ""
"``INTERNAL``,[[``NAME=``]\\ *name*],[[``FACTOR=``]\\ *fac*],\\ "
"*prim*,[[``FACTOR=``]\\ *fac*],\\ *prim,...;*"
msgstr ""
"``INTERNAL``,[[``NAME=``]\\ *name*],[[``FACTOR=``]\\ *fac*],\\ "
"*prim*,[[``FACTOR=``]\\ *fac*],\\ *prim,…;*"

msgid ""
"``FIX``, [[``NAME=``]\\ *name*],[[``FACTOR=``]\\ *fac*],\\ "
"*prim*,[[``FACTOR=``]\\ *fac*],\\ *prim,...;*"
msgstr ""
"``FIX``, [[``NAME=``]\\ *name*],[[``FACTOR=``]\\ *fac*],\\ "
"*prim*,[[``FACTOR=``]\\ *fac*],\\ *prim,…;*"

msgid ""
"Internal coordinates that are specified using ``INTERNAL`` are varied and "
"those using ``FIX`` are fixed to their initial values."
msgstr "使用 ``INTERNAL`` 指定的内坐标是可变的，而使用 ``FIX`` 指定的内坐标则固定为其初始值。"

msgid ""
"An important point for the definition of internal coordinates is that their "
"total number must be equal to the number of degrees of freedom of the "
"molecule . Otherwise an error message is generated. Only symmetry "
"independent coordinates need to be given."
msgstr "定义内坐标的一个重要点是，其总数必须等于分子的自由度数目。否则会生成错误信息。只需给出对称性独立的坐标。"

msgid "Additional options for SLAPAF"
msgstr "SLAPAF 的附加选项"

msgid ""
"Some options can be passed to the SLAPAF program. Options are specified with"
" SLOPT subdirective:"
msgstr "可以向 SLAPAF 程序传递一些选项。选项通过 SLOPT 子指令指定："

msgid "The available options are"
msgstr "可用的选项有"

msgid ""
"``CART`` Use eigenvectors of the approximate Hessian, expressed in cartesian"
" coordinates, as the definition of internal coordinates;"
msgstr "``CART`` 使用近似 Hessian 矩阵的特征向量（以笛卡尔坐标表示）作为内坐标的定义；"

msgid "``NOMA`` Don’t impose any restrictions on the step size;"
msgstr "``NOMA`` 不对步长施加任何限制；"

msgid ""
"``UORD`` Order the gradients and displacement vectors according to Schlegel "
"prior to the update of the Hessian. Default is no reordering;"
msgstr "``UORD`` 在更新 Hessian 矩阵之前，根据 Schlegel 方法对梯度和位移矢量进行排序。默认不重新排序；"

msgid "``HWRS`` Use force field weighted internal coordinates (default);"
msgstr "``HWRS`` 使用力场加权的内坐标（默认）；"

msgid ""
"``RS-P`` Activate RS-P-RFO as default for transition state search; default "
"is RS-I-RFO;"
msgstr "``RS-P`` 激活 RS-P-RFO 作为过渡态搜索的默认方法；默认是 RS-I-RFO；"

msgid "``NOHW`` Use unweighted internal coordinates;"
msgstr "``NOHW`` 使用未加权的内坐标；"

msgid "``PRBM`` Print B-matrix;"
msgstr "``PRBM`` 打印 B 矩阵；"

msgid ""
"``FIND`` Enable unconstrained optimization for constrained cases, when "
"looking for transition states (see MOLCAS manual)."
msgstr "``FIND`` 在寻找过渡态时，为受约束的情况启用无约束优化（参见 MOLCAS 手册）。"

msgid "For more information, please consult the MOLCAS manual."
msgstr "更多信息，请查阅 MOLCAS 手册。"

msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

msgid ""
"There is an additional example in the `introductory examples "
"<introductory_examples.html#geometry-optimizations>`__."
msgstr ""
"在 `入门示例 <introductory_examples.html#geometryoptimizations>`__ 中还有一个额外的示例。"

msgid "Simple HF optimization using Z-matrix"
msgstr "使用 Z-矩阵的简单 HF 优化"

msgid "Optimization using natural internal coordinates (BMAT)"
msgstr "使用自然内坐标（BMAT）进行优化"

msgid "MP2 optimization using a procedure"
msgstr "使用特定流程进行 MP2 优化"

msgid "Optimization using geometry DIIS"
msgstr "使用几何 DIIS 进行优化"

msgid "Transition state of the HCN – HNC isomerization"
msgstr "HCN – HNC 异构化的过渡态"

msgid ""
"The first example shows how to do a MP2 transition state optimization. The "
"initial Hessian is taken from a previous HF frequency calculation."
msgstr "第一个示例展示了如何进行 MP2 过渡态优化。初始 Hessian 矩阵取自先前的 HF 频率计算。"

msgid ""
"The second example shows how to do a CCSD(T) optimization with an MP2 "
"hessian. Note that currently the CCSD(T) gradient is computed numerically "
"using finite energy differences, and this can take long time for larger "
"molecules. The calculation of the MP2 hessian finite differences of "
"analytical gradients."
msgstr ""
"第二个示例展示了如何使用 MP2 Hessian 矩阵进行 CCSD(T) 优化。请注意，目前 CCSD(T) "
"梯度是通过有限能量差分进行数值计算的，对于较大的分子，这可能需要很长时间。MP2 Hessian 矩阵的计算则基于解析梯度的有限差分。"

msgid ""
"The last example shows how to do a MRCI+Q (MRCI with Davidson correction) "
"optimization with an CASPT2 hessian. As for CCSD(T), the MRCI+Q gradient as "
"computed numerically, while the CASPT2 hessian is obtained using finite "
"differences of analytical CASPT2 gradients."
msgstr ""
"最后一个示例展示了如何使用 CASPT2 Hessian 矩阵进行 MRCI+Q（带 Davidson 校正的 MRCI）优化。与 CCSD(T) "
"类似，MRCI+Q 梯度是数值计算的，而 CASPT2 Hessian 矩阵则是通过解析 CASPT2 梯度的有限差分获得的。"

msgid "Reaction path of the HCN – HNC isomerization"
msgstr "HCN – HNC 异构化的反应路径"

msgid ""
"The following input first optimizes the transition state, and then performs "
"reaction path calculations in both directions. The results are plotted."
msgstr "以下输入首先优化过渡态，然后沿两个方向进行反应路径计算。结果将被绘制。"

msgid "This produces the plots"
msgstr "这将生成以下图表"

msgid "hcn_dist.svg"
msgstr "hcn_dist.svg"

msgid "Optimizing counterpoise corrected energies"
msgstr "优化均衡校正能量"

msgid ""
"Geometry optimization of counterpoise corrected energies is possible by "
"performing for the total system as well as for each individual fragment "
"separate ``FORCE`` calculations. The gradients and energies are added using "
"the ``ADD`` directive. This requires that ``NOORIENT`` has been specified in"
" the geometry input, in order to avoid errors due to unintended rotation of "
"the system. This default can be disabled using the ``NOCHECK`` option, see "
"``ADD`` above."
msgstr ""
"通过为整个体系以及每个单独片段分别执行 ``FORCE`` 计算，可以实现对均衡校正能量的几何优化。梯度和能量使用 ``ADD`` "
"指令进行加和。这要求在几何输入中指定 ``NOORIENT``\\ ，以避免因体系意外旋转而导致的错误。此默认设置可以使用 ``NOCHECK`` "
"选项禁用，参见上文的 ``ADD``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"In the last example the monomer structures are kept fixed, and the "
"interaction energy is optimized."
msgstr "在最后一个示例中，单体结构保持固定，并优化了相互作用能。"

msgid "Adding CABS singles correction in CCSD(T)-F12 geometry optimization"
msgstr "在 CCSD(T)-F12 几何优化中添加 CABS 单激发修正"

msgid ""
"Geometry optimization using CCSD(T)-F12 method including CABS singles "
"corrections is possible by combining numerical gradients for HF+CABS singles"
" method and analytical gradients for DF-CCSD(T)-F12 method obtained in "
"separate ``FORCE`` calculations. The gradients are added using the ``ADD`` "
"directive. Similarly to the example `optimizing counterpoise corrected "
"energies <geometry_optimization_optg.html#optimizing-counterpoise-corrected-"
"energies>`__, ``NOORIENT`` is required. The following example shows geometry"
" optimization for the hydrogen fluoride molecule using DF-CCSD(T)-F12b "
"method without and with CABS singles correction."
msgstr ""
"使用包含 CABS 单激发修正的 CCSD(T)-F12 方法进行几何优化是可行的，这通过组合在单独的 ``FORCE`` 计算中获得的 HF+CABS"
" 单激发方法的数值梯度和 DF-CCSD(T)-F12 方法的解析梯度来实现。梯度使用 ``ADD`` 指令进行相加。类似于示例 `优化 "
"counterpoise 校正能量 <geometry_optimization_optg.html#optimizing-counterpoise-"
"corrected-energies>`__\\ ，需要使用 ``NOORIENT``\\ 。以下示例展示了使用 DF-CCSD(T)-F12b "
"方法对氟化氢分子进行几何优化，包括不包含和包含 CABS 单激发修正的情况。"
